    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Flight Cancellation Notification\\n\\nPurpose: notify passengers after an airline-initiated whole-flight cancellation.\\n\\n### Before activation\\n1. `audit_logs.processed_at` must already exist.\\n2. Replace `SET_SUPABASE_KEY_HERE` using your existing secure Supabase credential/header setup.\\n3. Connect your airline/system Gmail credential.\\n4. Test on a cancelled flight with cancelled bookings and `airline_cancellation` refund rows.\\n5. Keep workflow inactive until one manual execution succeeds.\\n\\n### Data used in the email\\n- flight number and route\\n- cancellation reason from audit/refund data\\n- booking ID\\n- refund amount\\n- refund status\\n\\nNo secrets are included in this JSON.",
        "height": 500,
        "width": 630
      },
      "id": "37efb5d9-ad95-4529-bbd8-4998a9c22ef8",
